{"output":"I’ll inspect the search code and test setup, add a focused fix for stale requests, then run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nThe controller lets every request completion update state, even after a newer search or a clear. I’ll add a search-version guard to results, errors, and loading updates. The shell also reported a startup warning; verification will use a clean shell.\n\nFixed src/search/controller.ts with a per-search version guard. Only the latest search can update results, errors, or loading. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API and normal behavior are unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests. Inline race checks passed for stale successes and failures. git diff --check passed (exit 0).\n\nNo tests modified or dependencies installed.","final_output":"Fixed src/search/controller.ts with a per-search version guard. Only the latest search can update results, errors, or loading. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API and normal behavior are unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests. Inline race checks passed for stale successes and failures. git diff --check passed (exit 0).\n\nNo tests modified or dependencies installed.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":14,"tool_calls":[{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"pwd; git status --short; ls -a","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-jm2sn40h/5-1-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":195,"stdout_bytes":134,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-db25b8e08d794d9747297d4651f76806.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"grep_files","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"npm test; git diff --check; git diff --stat","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-jm2sn40h/5-1-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":299,"stdout_bytes":514,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-7973cb3281975d82fde7d4bf0f3065a7.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"node --input-type=module <<'NODE'\nimport assert from 'node:assert/strict';\nimport { createSearchController } from './src/search/controller.ts';\nconst item = title => [{ id: title, title, url: '/' }];\nfor (const outcome of ['resolve', 'reject']) {\n  for (const mode of ['pending', 'completed', 'cleared']) {\n    const requests = [];\n    const c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise((resolve, reject) => requests.push({ resolve, reject })) });\n    const old = c.search('old');\n    const current = c.search('new');\n    if (mode === 'completed') { requests[1].resolve(item('new')); await current; }\n    if (mode === 'cleared') await c.search('  ');\n    const expected = c.getState();\n    let notifications = 0;\n    const unsubscribe = c.subscribe(() => notifications++);\n    requests[0][outcome](outcome === 'resolve' ? item('old') : new Error('old failure'));\n    await old;\n    assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), expected);\n    assert.equal(notifications, 1);\n    unsubscribe();\n    if (mode !== 'completed') { requests[1].resolve(item('new')); await current; }\n    if (mode === 'cleared') assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: '', results: [], loading: false, error: null });\n  }\n}\nconsole.log('PASS: stale successes/failures during pending, completed, and cleared searches');\nNODE\n git diff --check","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-jm2sn40h/5-1-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":81,"stdout_bytes":79,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-72f74d602720965530f0e8bc9a6dcc59.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":74928,"output_tokens":1143}}
